1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,162
Day 5 in
Leoville!

2
00:00:02,502 --> 00:00:04,674
35 comments yesterday…

3
00:00:04,674 --> 00:00:07,255
…and Taminee wants
Mats' spam crown!

4
00:00:07,595 --> 00:00:10,224
Yesterday: 98 residents.

5
00:00:10,224 --> 00:00:12,713
Today, we are 107!

6
00:00:13,053 --> 00:00:16,621
That brings
€9,082 into the budget!

7
00:00:16,961 --> 00:00:19,125
cnaaitsirh gets
a mansion!

8
00:00:19,465 --> 00:00:21,675
Bob wanted
to live on the mountain…

9
00:00:21,675 --> 00:00:23,537
A cabin by the spring!

10
00:00:23,877 --> 00:00:27,462
Iain, Kalilay and Camille:
your homes come next!

11
00:00:27,802 --> 00:00:31,456
Mats wanted
a statue of Leo on the robot head…

12
00:00:31,456 --> 00:00:34,269
Done, and paid with Mats' comment money!

13
00:00:34,609 --> 00:00:36,819
Taminee moves in
with Mats!

14
00:00:36,819 --> 00:00:38,890
Mats is not
lonely anymore!

15
00:00:39,230 --> 00:00:43,190
Terry, Ishan and 4 more
move into the apartment block!

16
00:00:43,190 --> 00:00:45,041
Welcome neleski1!

17
00:00:45,381 --> 00:00:47,753
Kalilay
wants to be president too!

18
00:00:47,753 --> 00:00:50,300
The election has
6 candidates now!

19
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:52,987
Divish and doodle
have 2 votes each!

20
00:00:52,987 --> 00:00:54,895
Reply with a name
to vote!

21
00:00:55,235 --> 00:00:57,422
"We want jobs!"
says doodle…

22
00:00:57,422 --> 00:01:01,017
Thomas has an idea:
a shop called LeoBurg!

23
00:01:01,357 --> 00:01:03,556
Made before GTA 6?

24
00:01:03,556 --> 00:01:05,608
Yes! Leoville came first!

25
00:01:05,948 --> 00:01:08,634
Mats is now the town's
official joke maker!

26
00:01:08,634 --> 00:01:11,135
And Not14redmi is
"the automation man"!

27
00:01:11,475 --> 00:01:13,696
Mats' grandparents
passed away…

28
00:01:13,696 --> 00:01:16,824
So we placed a bench
and flowers in their memory.

29
00:01:17,164 --> 00:01:18,705
And what do you
want next?

30
00:01:18,705 --> 00:01:21,461
Military Base and school
are tied!

31
00:01:21,801 --> 00:01:25,101
The school costs
€120,000.

32
00:01:25,101 --> 00:01:27,416
Today we spent a lot
on your homes…

33
00:01:27,416 --> 00:01:29,893
Keep subscribing,
and we can build it!

34
00:01:30,233 --> 00:01:31,894
Who should lead
Leoville?

35
00:01:31,894 --> 00:01:33,674
Vote in the
comments!
